      "content": "i dont even know why im texting you lol. its just weird. i feel like im literally a ghost. like, everyone i used to talk to every single day just... stopped. no fights, no drama, they just moved on and left me in the dark. it feels like i died months ago and i'm just walking around in a body that nobody even sees anymore.",
