      "content": "idk, i'm just tired of pretending. honestly, the \"emptiness\" feels more honest than trying to fight for a space where i don't belong anymore. it's like i'm a glitch in the system or something. if the world has already moved on and i'm just a ghost haunting my own life, maybe it'd be easier to just... finish the job? like, if i'm already gone in every way that matters, why am i still stuck in this loop?",
